parallel build system) instead of Make |\n\n```bash\n        -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n```\nSets optimization level. `Release` enables `-O3` optimizations and disables debug symbols. (Note: this pairs with `!debug` in the package options.)\n\n```bash\n        -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib \\\n```\n| Flag | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr` | Where"}